note: required by a bound in `Pick`
 --> src/layout.rs
  |
  | pub trait Pick<Digits>: SealedPick<Digits> {
  |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `Pick`
  = note: `Pick` is a "sealed trait", because to implement it you also need to implement `numo::layout::sealed::SealedPick`, which is not accessible; this is usually done to force you to use one of the provided types that already implement it
  = help: the following types implement the trait:
            numo::typenum::B0
            numo::typenum::B1
